# The phase 08 rollout story with the imperative verbs: create a Deployment, change its image with
# set image and record why with the change-cause annotation (kubectl has no --record at v1.37.2),
# watch rollout status, read history; a tag the registry does not have stalls the rollout until the
# default progress deadline (600 s of virtual time) and leaves one Pod in ImagePullBackOff; undo
# brings revision 2's template back as revision 4, restart rolls the same template again.
# Sources: the generators' and change verbs' golden cases (fixtures/golden/v1.37.2/generate/,
# change/), rollout/history-undo and rollout/pause-restart for history, undo and restart; the
# progress lines are printed once per watch event and come from upstream source
# (staging/src/k8s.io/kubectl/pkg/polymorphichelpers/rollout_status.go DeploymentStatusViewer).
# The annotation is copied to the ReplicaSet the controller creates for the new template
# (pkg/controller/deployment/util/deployment_util.go SetNewReplicaSetAnnotations).
$ kubectl create deployment web --image=nginx:1.27 --replicas=3
deployment.apps/web created
$ kubectl rollout status deployment/web
Waiting for deployment spec update to be observed...
Waiting for deployment spec update to be observed...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 0 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 0 of 3 updated replicas are available...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 1 of 3 updated replicas are available...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 2 of 3 updated replicas are available...
deployment "web" successfully rolled out
$ kubectl set image deployment/web nginx=nginx:1.28
deployment.apps/web image updated
$ kubectl annotate deployment/web kubernetes.io/change-cause="upgrade to nginx 1.28"
deployment.apps/web annotated
$ kubectl rollout status deployment/web
Waiting for deployment spec update to be observed...
Waiting for deployment spec update to be observed...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 0 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 1 old replicas are pending termination...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 1 old replicas are pending termination...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 1 old replicas are pending termination...
deployment "web" successfully rolled out
$ kubectl rollout history deployment/web
deployment.apps/web 
REVISION  CHANGE-CAUSE
1         <none>
2         upgrade to nginx 1.28

# A tag that does not exist: the new Pod cannot pull, and rollout status waits for the deadline.
$ kubectl set image deployment/web nginx=nginx:9.99
deployment.apps/web image updated
$ kubectl annotate deployment/web kubernetes.io/change-cause="try nginx 9.99" --overwrite
deployment.apps/web annotated
$ kubectl rollout status deployment/web
Waiting for deployment spec update to be observed...
Waiting for deployment spec update to be observed...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 0 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
error: deployment "web" exceeded its progress deadline
[exit 1]
